###############################################################################

# - Hierarchical GP results (energy-only RMSE 0.23, energy+force 0.15 meV/atom at N = 100; 1.12 at N = 20; hyperprior variants 0.91-1.10 meV/atom) are not encoded because GP regression potentials have no registry method yet (decision pending, see holzenkamp2025).
